                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "This patch itself seems like it's doing what's described.\n\nI do want to understand how a \"valve\" differs in application code from a leak detector.  Aren't both just sampling a GPIO, and publishing a DBus API?  Yes, the leak dbus api is different, but the majority is identical, so should we do what we've done in other places (like hwmon sensor) and combine multiple types into the same application?\n\nIf that question is answered somewhere, I'm good here."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Jagpal S Gill",
                        "email": "paligill@gmail.com",
                        "username": "jagpalgill"
                    },
                    "message": "Please refer https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/dbus-sensors/+/82574/comments/3cc0e73b_6a32035e for answer on this question."
                },
                {
